      "writtenOn": "2024-05-16T23:11:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "OK, thanks for the explanation!\n\nAgree, making the original property `system_public_prop` (by making it `audio_prop`) is even wider exposure than `system_vendor_config_prop`, via `audio_config_prop`.\n\nSo, are you going to try to get aosp/3067142 through?",
      "parentUuid": "a4b0db4b_91e54e32",
      "revId": "2b12aae043b594f91cd474cb516cfff4768f99f8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
